    },
    "Description": "The world is being dragged into its next age. In Cursed Gear, your mind is that of the human you used to be, but the form you wield is metal-cold, filled with unlimited potential.\n\nUndertake missions on expeditions in the Eastern Lands of Gaia and in Containment Zone 4, one of the last bastions of humanity and the testing grounds for the DARE Program.\n\nHarness the potential of your android form by equipping powerful cybernetic enhancements, hone your own techniques, and learn from the memories of forgotten masters.\n\nCreate powerful factions with trustworthy allies, crush your rivals, and forge a legacy as humanity’s last hope.\n\nPush back the threats encroaching from beyond the wall, and take humanity’s next step forward.\n--",
